                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Bubbles are 3–6 px mud-bubble circles, at most 3 at a time. Each rises 6–10 px over 1.4–2.2 s and pops with a 120 ms fade. The fill eases to each new level over 400 ms.",
                  "lineHeight": 1.33,
                  "fontFamily": "$font-ui",
                  "fontSize": 12,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
